IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. BRECEXC.

DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-SEQ PIC 9(12).
01 WS-SEQ-ST PIC X(02).
01 WS-SEQ-NAME PIC X(20) VALUE "RECEXC".
01 WS-ID-NUM PIC 9(11).
01 WS-ID-ED PIC X(11).
01 WS-NOW PIC X(14).
COPY "BRECP".

LINKAGE SECTION.
01 BK-REC-REC.
   COPY "BREC".
01 BK-EXC-REC.
   COPY "BRECE".

PROCEDURE DIVISION USING BK-REC-REC BK-EXC-REC.
    CALL "BSEQ" USING WS-SEQ-NAME WS-SEQ WS-SEQ-ST
    MOVE WS-SEQ TO WS-ID-NUM
    MOVE WS-ID-NUM TO WS-ID-ED
    MOVE SPACES TO EXC-ID
    STRING "E" DELIMITED SIZE WS-ID-ED DELIMITED SIZE
        INTO EXC-ID
    END-STRING
    MOVE REC-RUN-ID TO EXC-RUN-ID
    MOVE REC-TYPE TO EXC-TYPE
    MOVE REC-BIZDATE TO EXC-BIZDATE
    MOVE "OPEN" TO EXC-STATUS
    MOVE FUNCTION CURRENT-DATE TO WS-NOW
    MOVE WS-NOW(1:14) TO EXC-CREATED
    MOVE WS-NOW(1:14) TO EXC-UPDATED
    MOVE "WRITE" TO RP-OP
    CALL "BRECESO" USING BK-REC-PARMS BK-EXC-REC
    ADD 1 TO REC-EXCEPTIONS.
